            <h2 style="font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:500;">Group Study</h2>
            <p class="text-xs muted" style="margin-top:0.35rem;line-height:1.55;">Glass discussion rooms, whiteboard zones, and capstone team pods.</p>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
